| (4) + UQ Engine (NS-AI+UQ) | 0.562 | [0.477, 0.648] | 0.562 | [0.438, 0.688] |
| (5) Base + Symbolic Gate only | 0.805 | [0.734, 0.867] | 0.609 | [0.484, 0.734] |
